  "record": {
    "author_association": "OWNER",
    "body": "Found the map failure: the scanner called a single-result scenario native as if it filled an 8,192-item array, so it could corrupt its own state before creating a marker. I removed that call. The replacement records the exact position of each streamed p_waterpump01x and logs discovery, blip creation, failure, and idle heartbeat separately. The command-line extractor reaches the level archive but cannot decode its encrypted split YMAP entries, so remote unvisited-pump coverage is still not proved and the issue remains actionable.",
